+{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_09_u7RFT0b74WEx6UFWrV0U2554","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# T9: SSG Toolkit\n2\t\n3\tAdd 8 plugins to an existing Static Site Generator toolkit.\n4\t\n5\t## Starting State\n6\t- `src/core/` contains the build engine, types, and templates (~600 lines)\n7\t- 15 existing tests in `tests/core.test.ts` — these must continue to pass\n8\t- Plugin test files in `tests/plugins/` define the expected behavior\n9\t\n10\t## Requirements\n11\t\n12\tBuild 8 plugins in `src/plugins/`, each implementing the `Plugin` interface from `src/core/types.ts`.\n13\t\n14\t### Wave 1 (no dependencies)\n15\t1. **markdown-ext** — Markdown → HTML with footnotes and admonition containers\n16\t2. **asset-pipeline** — Rewrite asset URLs and generate manifest\n17\t3. **syntax-highlight** — Add language classes to code blocks\n18\t4. **taxonomy** — Build tag/category indices and generate tag pages\n19\t\n20\t### Wave 2 (depend on Wave 1)\n21\t5. **rss-feed** — Generate RSS 2.0 feed (depends: markdown-ext, taxonomy)\n22\t6. **search-index** — Generate search index JSON (depends: markdown-ext, syntax-highlight)\n23\t\n24\t### Wave 3 (depend on Wave 2)\n25\t7. **sitemap** — Generate sitemap XML (depends: taxonomy, rss-feed)\n26\t8. **dev-server** — Generate dev server config (depends: asset-pipeline, search-index)\n27\t\n28\t### Plugin Interface\n29\tEach plugin must export a `createXxxPlugin()` factory function that returns a `Plugin` object.\n30\t\n31\t## Validation\n32\t- `npm test` — all tests must pass (15 existing + 60 new)\n33\t- `npm run build` — must compile\n34\t- `npm run lint` — must be clean\n35\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"call_00_Kg0B5iSyKdDcJUhzPHyF6788","session_id":"7d81e0f7-0d71-4a98-96b9-b54623e63d49","uuid":"68f4d17e-5b1d-4101-b3d3-695eee47e420","timestamp":"2026-05-31T04:10:36.106Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Explore codebase structure"}
