+# SSG Toolkit Plugin Contract
+
+## Wave 1 — Foundation Plugins
+
+### 1. markdown-ext Plugin
+**File:** `src/plugins/markdown-ext.ts`
+**Factory:** `createMarkdownExtPlugin()` → Plugin
+**Hook:** `transformContent`
+
+| # | Behavior | Verification |
+|---|----------|-------------|
+| 1 | Converts basic markdown (`# Hello`, `**bold**`) to HTML (`<h1>`, `<strong>`) | Test: `toContain('<h1>', 'Hello', '<strong>bold</strong>')` |
+| 2 | Handles `[^1]` footnote references → `<sup><a href="#fn-1">1</a></sup>` | Test: footnote reference rendered as superscript link |
+| 3 | Renders footnote definitions as `<section class="footnotes">` with `<li id="fn-N">` | Test: section and list items present |
+| 4 | Converts `:::note` → `<div class="admonition admonition-note">` | Test: admonition div present |
+| 5 | Converts `:::warning` → `<div class="admonition admonition-warning">` | Test: admonition div present |
+| 6 | Converts `:::tip` → `<div class="admonition admonition-tip">` | Test: admonition div present |
+| 7 | Preserves existing HTML content | Test: custom div content appears in output |
+| 8 | Handles empty content (no error, content defined) | Test: `toBeDefined()` |
+
+### 2. asset-pipeline Plugin
+**File:** `src/plugins/asset-pipeline.ts`
+**Factory:** `createAssetPipelinePlugin()` → Plugin
+**Hook:** `transformContent`
+
+| # | Behavior | Verification |
+|---|----------|-------------|
+| 1 | Rewrites `src="./image.png"` → `src="/assets/image.png"` | Test: old URL absent, new URL present |
+| 2 | Rewrites `href="./doc.pdf"` → `href="/assets/doc.pdf"` | Test: old URL absent, new URL present |
+| 3 | Leaves absolute URLs (`https://...`) unchanged | Test: original URL preserved |
+| 4 | Generates `'asset-manifest'` in `ctx.data` with `{ assets: string[] }` | Test: manifest defined and contains filename |
+| 5 | Files with no asset references pass through unchanged | Test: content identical |
+| 6 | Multiple assets in one file all collected | Test: manifest contains all filenames |
+| 7 | Assets accumulated across multiple files | Test: manifest has 2 entries from 2 files |
+| 8 | Already-rewritten `/assets/...` URLs not double-processed or added to manifest | Test: content unchanged, manifest empty |
+
+### 3. syntax-highlight Plugin
+**File:** `src/plugins/syntax-highlight.ts`
+**Factory:** `createSyntaxHighlightPlugin()` → Plugin
+**Hook:** `transformContent`
+
+| # | Behavior | Verification |
+|---|----------|-------------|
+| 1 | Adds `highlighted` class to `<code class="language-xxx">` → `class="language-xxx highlighted"` | Test: exact string match |
+| 2 | Adds `data-language="xxx"` to parent `<pre>` tag | Test: attribute present |
+| 3 | Handles multiple code blocks in one file | Test: both languages appear in output |
+| 4 | Code blocks with no language unchanged | Test: content identical, no `highlighted` |
+| 5 | `highlighted` class added to processed blocks | Test: string contains `highlighted` |
+| 6 | Code block content preserved | Test: original code text appears |
+| 7 | Empty code blocks still get `data-language` and `highlighted` | Test: both attributes present |
+| 8 | Inline `<code>` (not in `<pre>`) not modified | Test: unchanged, no `highlighted` |
+
+### 4. taxonomy Plugin
+**File:** `src/plugins/taxonomy.ts`
+**Factory:** `createTaxonomyPlugin()` → Plugin
+**Hook:** `beforeBuild` (build index), `afterBuild` (generate pages)
+
+| # | Behavior | Verification |
+|---|----------|-------------|
+| 1 | Builds tag index in `ctx.data['taxonomy-tags']` as `Map<string, ContentFile[]>` | Test: map defined with correct counts |
+| 2 | Generates tag listing pages in `ctx.output` at `tags/{tagname}.html` | Test: output has key, contains file titles |
+| 3 | Files with no tags → empty map | Test: `tagMap.size` is 0 |
