+| 6 | Tag map stored in `ctx.data` | Test: `ctx.data.has('taxonomy-tags')` is true |
+| 7 | Empty file list → no errors | Test: afterBuild runs, map size 0 |
+| 8 | Tags case-normalized to lowercase | Test: 'JavaScript' and 'JAVASCRIPT' both → 'javascript' |
